% expect-error: undefined
% Scenario: a prototype that was never instantiated has no
% Implementation entry, and setpattern reports it undefined.
<< /PatternType 1 /PaintType 1 /TilingType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10]
  /XStep 10 /YStep 10 /PaintProc { pop 0 0 5 5 rectfill } >> setpattern
